Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.41,0:00:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心之地)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝉丸真是可惜啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就差那么一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再差一点点就能干掉九十九游马那家伙了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.96,0:00:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心之地)啊～ 好不甘心！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过下次一定不会有问题 是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)喂 苍蝇混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在那儿喋喋不休地耍嘴皮子。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)失败可不会再被原谅了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}噫！？ 是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我明白的 贝库塔大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一个刺客没问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无可挑剔地强！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 脾气很怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对上下关系特别严格
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像我这样的晚辈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋 是在耍我吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对、对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 他真的很强……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那个 前辈是水属性卡组的最强使用者……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记得是 神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也是水属性卡组的使用者。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:00:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一想到那家伙胸口就恶心到不行 唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了…… 好 Heartland。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就让凌牙的…… 让那家伙的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那个前辈去取回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.Heartland)遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凌牙：在那海底遗迹的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那里看到的传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确 那是我的记忆……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们究竟是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们一直在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.39,0:01:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个世界里。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，对吧？》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错，如果是那里的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个地方的话，我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我们……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我们的记忆》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)来来来，别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多吃点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})谢谢您。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不仅让我留宿，还准备了早餐。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)不过，为什么穿着制服呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，这个啊，因为没带
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}换洗衣服来，就找游马借了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)嘿嘿，你一直住着也没关系啦，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)谢谢你啊，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏你来了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马也终于能好好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能好好吃上饭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:03:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有啦，我也
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能吃到这么好吃的东西，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是走运了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过果然还是好吃啊，决斗饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral，你也想吃吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……啊哈哈哈……哈哈哈哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈……哈哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装傻可还太早了点哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来，现在可不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.65,0:04:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}慢悠悠吃饭的时候啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Heartland那帮家伙肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又会搞出什么名堂来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我觉得也该
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通知一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗和鲨鱼比较好。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗好像去调查什么了，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}联系不上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼他有鲨鱼的事……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直陪着璃绪小姐待在医院。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来大家一起去探望一下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讨厌 下起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈！ 全力冲刺飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是不是在勉强自己啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该还要花不少时间吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因如此 星光体的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才如此无可替代。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[广播]林老师 请紧急
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}联系护士中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[广播]林老师 请紧急联系护士中心……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 您要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是相关人员专用通道。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一般人士……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…… 走廊被水弄得湿淋淋的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你这人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样很为难啊。 到底在干什么……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(暗影)啊！？你这家伙说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说话注意点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底算什么东西啊？你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎……你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……你这家伙到底想干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对妹妹鲨鱼做了什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋……是九十九游马吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么找我……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……难道是巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等我收拾了鲨鱼那混蛋，下一个就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就发抖着等着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消……消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！鲨鱼那混蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道是鲨鱼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼那家伙，不出来。为什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！事到如今我们分头去找吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那让铁男他们也来帮忙吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也去叫哥哥他们……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《对了 那一天……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一天也是这样的雨天》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((璃绪：凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)等回到家以后再教我决斗哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)可以是可以但璃绪你动不动就哭啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪才不哭呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)明明就哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)才不哭呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不哭就不哭嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)肯定会哭的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看 你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们两个 差不多适可而止吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？ 这两个孩子的父母是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了。刚刚过世了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊…))
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 从那天起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和璃绪就只剩下两个人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 去那个地方…》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯茜)家里和学校街上都找不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)也依然联系不上…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)璃绪小姐都
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么难过了 那鲨鱼混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)这种时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是阿斯特拉尔在的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯茜)阿斯特拉尔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是那次事故以来第一次吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和璃绪小时候待过的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定 在这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的记忆应该就在这里》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((凌牙：还给我 璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是爸爸给我的重要的卡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要！ 因为只有凌牙太狡猾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！ 我说了等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说了还给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.61,0:10:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！ 危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.28,0:10:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老公！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈——！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的 璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易爸爸给我的卡被我弄脏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！ 别在意那种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老公 给凌牙处理一下伤口))
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 毫无疑问。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.25,0:11:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我身上的伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自过去的痛楚……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们重要的》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是什么巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就是神代凌牙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（克拉克）别想逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说“你这家伙”？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你算哪根葱？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为自己是谁啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？你在说什么呢，你这家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说话给我注意点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区人类，竟敢对这位巴利安大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋是巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说你自称水属性最强是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起什么鲨鱼，有更强～的水属性存在这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由身为前辈的我来告诉你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，怎么回事？力量……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？你这张脸，好像在哪见过……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了无所谓。怎么样，我这毒的滋味？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毒！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，毒要完全侵蚀你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还需要一些时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，从现在起你得跟我决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁会跟你这种杂鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别硬撑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你或许无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你妹妹会怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！？难道你这家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，让你们兄妹一起尝尝苦头。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解毒的方法只有一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是在决斗中打倒我。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须和我决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:12:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:12:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…你是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.59,0:13:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你忘了吗 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了你头号粉丝的脸！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.31,0:13:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 确实是 托隆的儿子。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 真是没出息啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毒？ 怎么可能会被刺到啊 正常来说。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被这种没用的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么 会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是被人拜托了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙让我来照顾你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 谁要你帮忙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})我才不管你呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你妹妹啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且你妹妹还在受苦这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.35,0:14:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}实在是让我睡不踏实啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用本大爷的粉丝福利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧把这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给揍趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就在旁边看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少自作主张了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你们这帮家伙别小看人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是哪个中学的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}行啊 两个人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.49,0:14:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放马过来吧 混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.89,0:14:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人一起放马过来吧 混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 怎么办。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴里安那家伙都那么说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救璃绪 我要救璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.51,0:14:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，看来没人有异议了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，有个条件。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}条件？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们几个怎么看都比我小十岁。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}后辈就得给前辈面子。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前辈我的生命值是8000。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些后辈各自算2000。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切，嘴上叫前辈人倒是挺抠的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}行啊，正好是个不错的 handicap。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区后辈，还挺狂。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}趁胜负还没分出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别让毒蔓延开被冲上海滩啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你的真面目！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.97,0:15:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（三人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 鲨鱼那家伙 到底 去哪了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 刚才哥哥大人来联系了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼出大事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《无论如何都一定要救出璃绪》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤赛巴斯·鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.43,0:16:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}标签决斗双方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第1回合不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不像你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也太谨慎了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我不能输。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢 绝对要赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤死亡剑龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.18,0:16:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 当我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.91,0:16:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有水属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤这张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，沉默·海鳝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前辈的认真，从这里开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我看好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的死亡锁链和
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沉默·海鳝进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.81,0:17:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.4！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漂荡于混沌之中的透明战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}洞悉一切，刺穿世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伟大的前辈，在此降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猛毒刺胞 水母水母！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.4！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4可是我的专利！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是特别的数字！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且这算什么啊，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.4居然是水母！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是瞧不起水母吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性最强的生物正是水母。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不死的生命将以死亡之毒将你们刺穿。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就说不听吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我才叫你在旁边看着啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要按你朋友说的做吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭……闭嘴 水母混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么就由我来给你致命一击吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 斯特尔水母的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方回合各一次 可以破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上1只水属性怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 救生鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将救生鲨攻击力数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毒刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这点程度算不了什么吧 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还嘴硬呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混账东西，这次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}换我来好好伺候你！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤机关傀儡·毁灭者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡机关宝牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以破坏场上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一只机关傀儡怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择毁灭者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我抽一张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，毁灭者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被卡的效果破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌将攻击力1000以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只机关傀儡怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，机关傀儡·小丑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有，死灵人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧！我用等级８的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诡计傀儡 骑士小丑和死灵人偶超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.91,0:20:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.99,0:20:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.15！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操纵命运之线的地狱使者。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从漆黑的黑暗中拉开舞台的帷幕吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诡计傀儡 巨型杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个 No.是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.65,0:20:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 连你也中了毒…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 巨型杀手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上 除这只怪兽以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 你要承受被破坏的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我吃下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星辉圣像的攻击力是 1900。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我的粉丝福利，收下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏加农！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用游马托付给我的巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来就应该由原本的主人使用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能绽放出真正的光辉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绽放光辉？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这点程度别给我得意忘形啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区小我10届的后辈{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别给我蹬鼻子上脸啊你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？ 怪兽有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克拉格你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是混蛋，是前辈！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:21:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就让你好好见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.03,0:22:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见识一下克拉格的最强传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.76,0:23:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.97,0:23:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.56,0:23:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
